{"speciesId":185,"names":{"fr":"Simularbre","es":"Sudowoodo","en":"Sudowoodo","ja":"ウソッキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composi­ tion appears to be closer to a rock than a plant."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It disguises it­ self as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"If a tree branch shakes when there is no wind, it's a SUDOWOODO, not a tree. It hides from the rain."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. But since its forelegs remain green throughout the year, it is easily identified as a fake in the winter."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears to be closer to a rock than a plant."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Despite appearing to be a tree, its body is closer to rocks and stones. It is very weak to water."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It stands along paths pretending to be a tree. If it starts raining, it seems to disappear."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il prend l’apparence d’un arbre pour éviter les attaques, mais il déteste l’eau et fuit la pluie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il prend l’apparence d’un arbre pour éviter les attaques, mais il déteste l’eau et fuit la pluie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il fait semblant d’être un arbre. Sa composition est en fait plus proche de la pierre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aunque pretende ser un árbol, en su composición se parece más a una roca que a una planta."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いつも 木のふりを している。 体の つくりは 植物より 石や 岩などに 近いようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se déguise en arbre pour éviter les problèmes. Il déteste l’eau et se cache par temps de pluie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se disfraza de árbol para no ser atacado. Odia el agua, por lo que desaparecerá si empieza a llover."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"襲われないように 木の真似をする。 水が 苦手で 雨が 降り出すと いつの間にか 姿を 消す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Simularbre se camoufle en arbre pour éviter d’être attaqué par ses ennemis. Mais étant donné que ses pattes restent vertes toute l’année, ce Pokémon est facile à repérer pendant l’hiver."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sudowoodo se camufla adoptando la imagen de un árbol para que no le ataque ningún enemigo. El problema viene en invierno, ya que las extremidades superiores tienen color verde y es fácil identificarle."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sudowoodo camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because its hands remain green throughout the year, the Pokémon is easily identified as a fake during the winter."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"敵に 襲われない ように 木の ふりをする。 両手は １年中 緑色なので 冬は 偽物だと すぐに ばれてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Simularbre se camoufle en arbre pour éviter d’être attaqué par ses ennemis. Mais étant donné que ses pattes restent vertes toute l’année, ce Pokémon est facile à repérer pendant l’hiver."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sudowoodo se camufla adoptando la imagen de un árbol para que no le ataque ningún enemigo. El problema viene en invierno, ya que las extremidades superiores tienen color verde y es fácil identificarle."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sudowoodo camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because its hands remain green throughout the year, the Pokémon is easily identified as a fake during the winter."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"敵に 襲われない ように 木の ふりをする。 両手は １年中 緑色なので 冬は 偽物だと すぐに ばれてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il imite un arbre pour passer inaperçu, mais il déteste tellement l’eau qu’il prend ses jambes à son cou s’il se fait arroser."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se disfraza de árbol para no ser atacado. Huirá rápidamente si alguien le echa agua por encima, pues no la soporta."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"To avoid attack, it mimics a tree. It will run off if splashed with water, which it hates."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"襲われないため 樹木の 真似を するが 嫌いな 水を かけられて あわてて 逃げだしていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Très populaire, notamment chez les personnes âgées. Plus la partie verte est grande, plus ses fans se l’arrachent."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es bastante popular entre la gente de mayor edad. La pasión que le profesan los fanáticos es proporcional al tamaño de su parte verde."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Apparently, the larger the green parts of this Pokémon, the more collectors value it. It’s a particular favorite among elderly people."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"お年寄りを 中心に 人気。 緑の 部分が 大きいほど マニアの 評価は あがるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fait l’objet de revues spécialisées tant il est populaire auprès des personnes âgées. Ses fans aiment surtout la longueur et l’angle de ses bras."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Aparece en algunas revistas especializadas populares entre la gente mayor. Sus fans adoran lo largo y anguloso de sus extremidades."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s so popular with the elderly that there’s a magazine devoted to this Pokémon. Fans obsess over the particular length and angle of its arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"お年寄りに 人気で 専門誌も あるほど。 愛好家は 腕の 長さや 角度に こだわるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La souplesse et la robustesse de ses bras sont le fruit d’un entraînement long et rigoureux qui consiste en une immobilité prolongée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A fuerza de mantener la misma postura, sus extremidades se han vuelto flexibles y robustas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The result of its holding the same pose all the time is arms that have become supple yet strong."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"しなやか かつ たくましい 腕は 同じポーズを とり続けるうちに 鍛えられた 賜物 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Si une branche remue alors qu’il n’y a pas de vent, c’est qu’il s’agit d’un Simularbre. On n’en croise jamais les jours de pluie."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Quien vea agitarse un árbol sin que sople el viento habrá encontrado un Sudowoodo. En los días lluviosos, sin embargo, se esconde."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If a tree branch shakes when there is no wind, it’s a Sudowoodo, not a tree. It hides from the rain."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"風も ないのに 揺れている 木を 見かけたら それが ウソッキー。 雨の日は 姿を 隠すという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se déguise en arbre pour éviter de se faire attaquer. Il déteste l’eau et se cache par temps de pluie."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Finge ser un árbol para evitar que lo ataquen. Odia tanto el agua que desaparecerá si empieza a llover."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"襲われないように 木のまねをする。 水が 苦手で 雨が 降り出すと いつの間にか 姿を 消す。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though it pretends to be a tree, it fails to fool even children. To the touch, its body feels more like rock than tree bark. Sudowoodo's extreme aversion to water merits special note."}],"varieties":[{"id":185,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,